blkdev_get_size() asks BLKGETSIZE64 only when the release uname() reports
is not one of the kernel versions whose BLKGETSIZE64 was broken (2.4.15 to
2.4.17), reading anything below 2.6 as suspect.  On LikeOS that release is
the LikeOS version ("0.2.9"), which would turn the request off for no
reason; the version test is skipped and BLKGETSIZE64 is always asked.

